WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.111 --> 00:00:05.360
Emily · Agent: Good afternoon, you're through to Emily at Holcim. How can I help?

2
00:00:06.341 --> 00:00:14.613
Jamie · Customer: Afternoon Emily. I'm after 120 tonnes of 10mm Surface Course for a council road job next Thursday night.

3
00:00:15.761 --> 00:00:24.681
Emily · Agent: I can definitely schedule that night delivery for you. With it being a council job, do they have you chasing any strict carbon reduction targets?

4
00:00:25.661 --> 00:00:35.887
Jamie · Customer: Yeah, it's a massive pain. It's this some green corridor thing, so we have to prove carbon savings on everything we use.

5
00:00:46.271 --> 00:00:59.791
Emily · Agent: We can definitely help make that easier. If you're doing any kerb bedding or drainage work on that stretch, we can supply our ECOPact low-carbon concrete. It cuts carbon by up to 70%.

6
00:01:00.771 --> 00:01:08.059
Jamie · Customer: We do have about 300 metres of kerbing to reset, actually. Will it set the same as the normal stuff?

7
00:01:09.171 --> 00:01:23.651
Emily · Agent: Exactly the same strength and setting time. We can also swap your sub-base for our recycled aggregates. It meets all the highway specs, and having our carbon saving figures will look brilliant on your handover report.

8
00:01:24.631 --> 00:01:31.589
Jamie · Customer: Sounds good. Put the ECOPact stuff and the recycled stone on the quote as well. That'll keep them off my back.

9
00:01:32.711 --> 00:01:37.080
Emily · Agent: I'll include those on the quote for you. Is there anything else I can help with?

10
00:01:38.051 --> 00:01:40.813
Jamie · Customer: No thanks, that's everything. Have a great day.

11
00:01:42.021 --> 00:01:44.156
Emily · Agent: You too, Jamie. Bye.
